  "left": 0.23193400496144836,
  "right": 0.7889475604457499,
  "rows": [
    {
      "text": "All disciplinary cases classified as Major offenses and Serious",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.029833633452653885,
        "width": 0.5069073836008708,
        "x": 0.2765177583994303,
        "y": 0.23515471517749287
      },
      "level": 0.24902128199756302
    },
    {
      "text": "offenses shall be heard by an ad hoc Committee on Discipline to be",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.027589427307248116,
        "width": 0.5436337391535441,
        "x": 0.23976489551361965,
        "y": 0.2517608145873712
      },
      "level": 0.26391796815839574
    },
    {
      "text": "formed by the President of the College. The Committee's decisions",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.030075740069150925,
        "width": 0.5475414594014485,
        "x": 0.23789863067395464,
        "y": 0.2664415495876369
      },
      "level": 0.27977851668243825
    },
    {
      "text": "are recommendatory and become final and immediately executory",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02820797823369503,
        "width": 0.5455351273218791,
        "x": 0.23983938706608007,
        "y": 0.2826639151908479
      },
      "level": 0.29468377505056775
    },
    {
      "text": "upon the approval of the President.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02314835600554943,
        "width": 0.26858643690745043,
        "x": 0.23976569371354098,
        "y": 0.30291647451780124
      },
      "level": 0.3107415187343894
    },
    {
      "text": "Any misconduct not otherwise specified in the Student",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.025304192677140236,
        "width": 0.5142992734909058,
        "x": 0.27486003934205244,
        "y": 0.3204664054261628
      },
      "level": 0.3300201403377685
    },
    {
      "text": "Handbook, whether committed inside or outside the school campus,",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.024034006521105766,
        "width": 0.5488827625910441,
        "x": 0.23818413904843672,
        "y": 0.33638431952881986
      },
      "level": 0.34506233927409524
    },
    {
      "text": "during and outside school hours, shall be punished accordingly for as",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.024469616822898388,
        "width": 0.5472013552983602,
        "x": 0.23998090087921367,
        "y": 0.35251127750151845
      },
      "level": 0.35996749027171226
    },
    {
      "text": "long as the misconduct is adverse to the school's good order or",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.021604050882160664,
        "width": 0.5489705006281533,
        "x": 0.24008293894215002,
        "y": 0.3684042248591969
      },
      "level": 0.3763170050174186
    },
    {
      "text": "discipline, welfare, good name and reputation, or shall affect the",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02528322394937277,
        "width": 0.5491164922714233,
        "x": 0.23809503028891088,
        "y": 0.38259019840837705
      },
      "level": 0.39102241348804223
    },
    {
      "text": "student's status or shall adversely affect the interest and welfare of",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02432342618703842,
        "width": 0.5510827302932739,
        "x": 0.23808933212786934,
        "y": 0.3981187420414274
      },
      "level": 0.4059111976513152
    },
    {
      "text": "other students, faculty members, and school personnel.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.021497145295143127,
        "width": 0.43463265895843506,
        "x": 0.2400204176289161,
        "y": 0.41548042677492536
      },
      "level": 0.42162542397306
    },
    {
      "text": "D. Special Provisions",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.014682503417134285,
        "width": 0.18023254474004108,
        "x": 0.2771317918983902,
        "y": 0.44186046530350864
      },
      "level": 0.44186046530350864
    },
    {
      "text": "1. All regulations formulated by the Department of Education",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.019721660763025284,
        "width": 0.5100487073262532,
        "x": 0.2403100778524371,
        "y": 0.4590457418584333
      },
      "level": 0.46327077239985326
    },
    {
      "text": "(DepEd), the Commission on Higher Education (CHED), and",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.017634902149438858,
        "width": 0.5116279125213623,
        "x": 0.2751937956896735,
        "y": 0.47509765642945434
      },
      "level": 0.47509765642945434
    },
    {
      "text": "other higher offices and all existing laws of the Philippines shall",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.019571231678128242,
        "width": 0.5139154195785522,
        "x": 0.27503214086719757,
        "y": 0.4897537757306726
      },
      "level": 0.493568434812072
    },
    {
      "text": "be considered and are hereby incorporated as part of these rules",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.016170058399438858,
        "width": 0.5135658979415894,
        "x": 0.27519379888357953,
        "y": 0.507267441680392
      },
      "level": 0.507267441680392
    },
    {
      "text": "and regulations on discipline.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.014534883201122284,
        "width": 0.2306201457977295,
        "x": 0.27519380595287934,
        "y": 0.5232558142133923
      },
      "level": 0.5232558142133923
    },
    {
      "text": "2. For the purpose of meting out the proper penalty for those not so",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.017589479684829712,
        "width": 0.5155038833618164,
        "x": 0.23643410906746887,
        "y": 0.5434570312705094
      },
      "level": 0.5434570312705094
    },
    {
      "text": "provided in the Rules for Students Discipline, the School",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.017578125,
        "width": 0.5193798144658406,
        "x": 0.2732558328833587,
        "y": 0.5595703127396819
      },
      "level": 0.5595703127396819
    },
    {
      "text": "Administration shall be guided by the Manual of Regulations, and",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.017680322751402855,
        "width": 0.5174418687820435,
        "x": 0.2732558142717689,
        "y": 0.5755813960214051
      },
      "level": 0.5755813960214051
    },
    {
      "text": "DepEd or CHED.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.014534883201122284,
        "width": 0.13759689529736835,
        "x": 0.2732558172931763,
        "y": 0.5915697676726946
      },
      "level": 0.5915697676726946
    },
    {
      "text": "XII. Code of Conduct",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01611328125,
        "width": 0.19767441352208454,
        "x": 0.4108527138203531,
        "y": 0.6220703127083136
      },
      "level": 0.6220703127083136
    },
    {
      "text": "Article I - General Behavior",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.014761990867555141,
        "width": 0.2558139562606811,
        "x": 0.3817829461775221,
        "y": 0.639534883939306
      },
      "level": 0.639534883939306
    },
    {
      "text": "Section 1. Students shall at all times be neat, clean, decent in",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.020114505663514137,
        "width": 0.5274639924367268,
        "x": 0.2672717972618505,
        "y": 0.6712530791493954
      },
      "level": 0.6712530791493954
    },
    {
      "text": "their clothing, orderly, respectful, and courteous in their conduct.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.020390359684824944,
        "width": 0.5178125699361166,
        "x": 0.23236822476499297,
        "y": 0.687108846204856
      },
      "level": 0.687108846204856
    },
    {
      "text": "Section 2. Students shall refrain from using language and",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02562178671360016,
        "width": 0.5297063986460367,
        "x": 0.26706364863878207,
        "y": 0.7002955655079781
      },
      "level": 0.7002955655079781
    },
    {
      "text": "committing acts that are disrespectful, vulgar, or indecent, or which in",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.019122456200420856,
        "width": 0.5639534791310628,
        "x": 0.23255814793446858,
        "y": 0.7207031252322709
      },
      "level": 0.7207031252322709
    },
    {
      "text": "any manner may cause or tend to disturb other students, faculty",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02081412822008133,
        "width": 0.5661638180414836,
        "x": 0.23240184967111124,
        "y": 0.736814109919072
      },
      "level": 0.736814109919072
    },
    {
      "text": "members, employees, or officials of the Administration of the College.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.023212775588035583,
        "width": 0.56259290377299,
        "x": 0.23227699535836632,
        "y": 0.7503586424915034
      },
      "level": 0.7503586424915034
    },
    {
      "text": "Section 3. Students shall not bring into the College objects,",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.023408010601997375,
        "width": 0.5336108605066934,
        "x": 0.2651727133609722,
        "y": 0.7673010491535222
      },
      "level": 0.7673010491535222
    },
    {
      "text": "pictures, or literature that are morally offensive.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02215546928346157,
        "width": 0.3806039492289225,
        "x": 0.23221598875779645,
        "y": 0.7817598179566534
      },
      "level": 0.7817598179566534
    },
    {
      "text": "Section 4. Students shall not bring into the premises of the College any",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.025128841400146484,
        "width": 0.5298406680425007,
        "x": 0.26895231646089685,
        "y": 0.7977795190127186
      },
      "level": 0.7977795190127186
    },
    {
      "text": "alcoholic drink, or any prohibited drug or opiate, or enter the College",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02648522239178419,
        "width": 0.5666928688685099,
        "x": 0.23209029810434023,
        "y": 0.8119093945256672
      },
      "level": 0.8119093945256672
    },
    {
      "text": "premises under the influence of liquor or drug.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02526395209133625,
        "width": 0.33856328328450525,
        "x": 0.23193400496144836,
        "y": 0.8250477921500974
      },
      "level": 0.8250477921500974
    },
    {
      "text": "25",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.011627906933426857,
        "width": 0.0232558126250903,
        "x": 0.49418604746652467,
        "y": 0.8808139534373564
      },
      "level": 0.8808139534373564
    }
  ],
